Z||000011||Raydar||09-09-2001||02:17 AM||||At one time I had a phone number that had previously belonged to a company that rebuilt pool tables. You <I>just can't imagine</I> some of the calls that we got.<P>About that same time we had an outgoing message on our machine that sounded like we had about two dozen dogs barking in the room (was from a sound effects recording). "Hi! We can't get to the phone... etc."<BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
